flowchart TB
    accTitle: How the projects belong together
    accDescr: The tools for maintainers are on top. Repo Blueprint makes every repository, also those of the issue assistant and of Repo Pager, and brings each of its releases to all of them; the issue assistant triages the issues of every repository, Repo Pager reports what needs its maintainer, such as a failed run, and the repository dashboard shows the state of each. Below them are the apps, each with what it connects to. HomeDarts for Autodarts brings an Autodarts board into Home Assistant, and Player Switch for Autodarts switches the players of a shared board in the browser. Paperless Sync brings the documents of Paperless-ngx into Nextcloud as an archive, and Paperless Unified Search brings the search of Paperless-ngx into that of Nextcloud, where a result opens the file that Paperless Sync brought.

    subgraph maintainers["Tools for maintainers"]
        direction TB
        repo-blueprint["Repo Blueprint<br>makes every repository"]
        issue-assistant["Issue assistant<br>triages the issues"]
        repo-pager["Repo Pager<br>reports a failed run"]
        dashboard["Repository dashboard<br>the state of each"]
        repo-blueprint --> issue-assistant & repo-pager
        repo-pager ~~~ dashboard
    end

    subgraph apps["Apps"]
        direction TB
        subgraph darts["For an Autodarts board"]
            direction TB
            board(["An Autodarts board"])
            homedarts-for-autodarts["HomeDarts for Autodarts"]
            player-switch-for-autodarts["Player Switch for Autodarts"]
            homeassistant(["Home Assistant"])
            browser(["The browser"])
            board --> homedarts-for-autodarts & player-switch-for-autodarts
            homedarts-for-autodarts --> homeassistant
            player-switch-for-autodarts --> browser
        end
        subgraph archive["For Nextcloud and Paperless-ngx"]
            direction TB
            paperless(["Paperless-ngx"])
            paperless-sync["Paperless Sync<br>the documents<br>as an archive"]
            paperless-unified-search["Paperless Unified Search<br>the search, which opens<br>the files of Paperless Sync"]
            nextcloud(["Nextcloud"])
            paperless --> paperless-sync & paperless-unified-search
            paperless-sync & paperless-unified-search --> nextcloud
        end
        darts ~~~ archive
    end

    maintainers == "make and look after<br>every repository" ==> apps

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class repo-blueprint,issue-assistant,repo-pager,dashboard bot
    class board,homeassistant,browser,paperless,nextcloud person
    class homedarts-for-autodarts,player-switch-for-autodarts,paperless-sync,paperless-unified-search done
